    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "This home is professionally managed by Beach Habitats 30A. The home comes with 6 beach cruiser bikes and access to all community pools. (Private Beach Club NOT Included)<br><br>Step into coastal luxury at this stunning four‑story beach home located in the exclusive, gated Watersound Beach community. With 5,002 sq ft of beautifully designed living space, this home blends high‑end finishes, spacious gathering areas, and serene outdoor living to create the perfect 30A getaway for families, groups, and multi‑generational vacations.<br><br>✨ Property Highlights<br>6 spacious bedrooms<br>5.5 total baths for maximum comfort and privacy<br>Elevator access to all floors<br>Two living areas plus multiple porches for relaxing and entertaining<br>Chef’s kitchen with premium appliances, gas range, wine fridge, ice maker, and oversized island<br>Hardwood and tile flooring throughout<br>Wet bar <br>Two gas fireplaces for cozy evenings<br>Newly painted interior with elegant coastal finishes<br><br>🏖 Outdoor Living<br>Enjoy the best of Florida’s coastal lifestyle with:<br>Multiple porches (open and screened) perfect for morning coffee or sunset cocktails<br>Private balcony with Gulf views<br>Outdoor shower<br>Access to Watersound’s resort‑style pools, fitness center, boardwalks, and private beach access<br><br>🍽 Gourmet Kitchen & Dining<br>The fully equipped kitchen is designed for hosting and features:<br>Gas stove/oven<br>Large island with seating<br>Wine refrigerator<br>Ice machine<br>Walk‑in pantry<br>High‑end stainless appliances<br>Perfect for cooking large meals or bringing in a private chef.<br><br>🛏 Bedroom Layout<br>Sleeps up to 16 comfortably <br>Each bedroom includes its own private bathroom, making this home ideal for groups who want both shared spaces and personal retreats.<br><br>🌊 Location<br>Nestled behind the secure gates of Watersound Beach, this home offers:<br>Direct access to pristine white‑sand beaches<br>Walkability to The Big Chill (formerly The Hub) for dining, shopping, and entertainment<br>Quick access to Seaside, Alys Beach, and Rosemary Beach<br>Peaceful, private streets perfect for biking and strolling<br><br>🏡 Community Amenities<br>Guests have access to:<br>Resort‑style pools<br>Fitness center<br>Private beach access<br>Boardwalks and nature trails<br>Gated security<br>Playground<br><br>🚗 Parking<br>2‑car garage plus additional driveway parking<br><br>🌟 Why Guests Love This Home<br>Ideal for large families and multi‑family vacations<br>Luxurious yet comfortable coastal design<br>Quiet, private community with premium amenities<br>Spacious layout with room for everyone to spread out",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "Luxury Watersound Beach Retreat on Scenic 30A"
        }
      ],
